  description: '"Vehicroid Connection Zone" can be used to Fusion Summon any "roid"
    monsters from your Extra Deck. All "roid" monsters whose original Level is 6
    or lower can be Normal Summoned/Set without Tributing. If a non-Fusion "roid"
    Machine monster you control whose original Level is 6 or lower attacks an opponent''s
    monster, it gains ATK equal to its own Level x 100 during the Damage Step only.
    If you control a non-Machine monster, flip this card over.'
